---
import UiIcon from "../icons/UiIcon.astro";
---

<header class="resources-heading">
  <div class="resources-heading-copy">
    <ol class="breadcrumb">
      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li aria-current="page">Risorse</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="resources-eyebrow">Risorse · privacy, stati, domande</p>
    <h1>Capire cosa succede, prima di iniziare.</h1>
    <p class="resources-lede">
      Dove vengono letti i tuoi file, quali strumenti usano la rete, cosa resta salvato
      nel browser e come leggere un errore. Con i nomi veri delle cose.
    </p>
  </div>
  <aside class="resources-heading-aside" aria-label="In breve">
    <p class="resources-aside-kicker">In breve</p>
    <ul>
      <li><UiIcon name="devices" size={18} /><span>I file che apri vengono letti nel browser e non arrivano ai nostri server.</span></li>
      <li><UiIcon name="search" size={18} /><span>Cinque strumenti usano la rete, solo quando premi il pulsante: <a href="#rete">quali e perché</a>.</span></li>
      <li><UiIcon name="check-circle" size={18} /><span>Un risultato compare solo dopo un'operazione vera, mai prima.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </aside>
</header>

<style>
  .resources-heading {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .resources-heading-copy { max-width: var(--measure-copy); }

  .resources-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    color: var(--brand);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1060px) {
    .resources-heading { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-10); }
  }

  .resources-heading h1 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--font-size-display);
    line-height: var(--line-height-display);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
  }

  .resources-lede {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-body-lg);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .resources-heading-aside {
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    border: var(--border-width) solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--brand-soft);
  }

  .resources-aside-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  }

  .resources-heading-aside ul { display: grid; gap: var(--space-3); margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }

  .resources-heading-aside li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .resources-heading-aside li :global(svg) { margin-top: 2px; color: var(--brand); }
</style>
